              title: GuideText(en: "Remember", fr: "À retenir"),
              body: GuideText(en: "Conversations preserve chats; memory preserves selected reusable facts. Review and delete them through their separate controls.", fr: "Les conversations conservent les discussions ; la mémoire conserve certains faits réutilisables. Gérez-les avec leurs commandes distinctes."),
            ),
          ],
          visual: GuideVisual(
